{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tumble topsy-turvy down the rabbit hole into the fantastical frolic of Escaping Wonderland, where whimsy waltzes with wonder and riddles run riot! Join the ever-curious Molly on a brand-new adventure through the beloved world of Alice in Wonderland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/d6dcc90b17974ecb9ea7f48a27cce568.poster.avif?t=1751036913\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/d6dcc90b17974ecb9ea7f48a27cce568.webm?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/d6dcc90b17974ecb9ea7f48a27cce568.mp4?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf33 Delightful diorama-style immersive environments to lose yourself in</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude40 Hours of whimsical gameplay with perplexing puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd8b Mingle with marvelous characters from the world of Alice in Wonderland</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/076a439a4b18248ab645e0879ad5151d.poster.avif?t=1751036913\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/076a439a4b18248ab645e0879ad5151d.webm?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/076a439a4b18248ab645e0879ad5151d.mp4?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Delightful diorama-style immersive environments</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for hours of gameplay, brimming with brain-teasers, enchantment, and just the right dash of delightful nonsense. Will Molly navigate her way out, or will she unearth the curious truth that sometimes the best way out is further in? Step into this whimsical whirlwind and discover what Molly is really escaping from and help her recover her memory\u2014if you dare!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/7ba347720196887aa5b0993a2b773ca8.poster.avif?t=1751036913\" width=800 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/7ba347720196887aa5b0993a2b773ca8.webm?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3471390/extras/7ba347720196887aa5b0993a2b773ca8.mp4?t=1751036913\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83d\ude40 Whimsical gameplay with perplexing puzzles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle your way through perplexing challenges and lose yourself in an enchanting landscape where up is down, left is right, and nothing is quite as it seems (except when it is, and even then, it might not be).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escaping Wonderland is a new chapter in the <strong>Down the Rabbit Hole</strong> saga, and an all-new story from the same developers who brought you the original, Cortopia Studios.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rise from Rock Bottom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps